=2 Walkthrough
__You must zone after completing {q:Voices from Beyond|Voices from Beyond|Voices from Beyond} before you can start this quest.__
* Talk to {p:Rukususu (A)} (F-10)
** South of Veridical Conflux #7, near the encampment by the waterfall. **Do not drop down the river!**
* Head to the **Fay Pond** at (F-5) in the **Witchfire Glen** area of the map via Conflux #5.
* You must trade {@i:Twinkle Powder|1241} {i:Twinkle Powder|Twinkle Powder|1241} to the **Fay Pond** for a chance to receive the {@k} {k:Pinch of pixie dust}.
** Bring multiples as the chance of obtaining the pixie dust is random.
* Return to {p:Rukususu (A)} to complete this quest.

__Zoning **is** required in order to repeat this quest.__
